se,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"/=RK"}]},{"client_msg_id":"176187f7-befe-4da2-90e8-66e6d92bc69b","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"とりあえずvim-lsp-settingsは何も考えなくても動くように設計されているのでめっちゃ楽です","ts":"1636554663.332200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"4Iz5G"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0f7ea635-4658-4a18-bf8d-1d5b43ce9921","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"逆にnvim-lspが気になっている(vim-lsp-settingsが快適すぎて抜け出せない)","ts":"1636554628.331800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"+va"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7e373e87-6e69-4ec6-a1e2-ae56fd6f8f97","type":"message","user":"U02EKL7FDBR","text":"今、neovimで使うlspクライアントについて迷っています。\nneovimを使っているので、今はnvim-lspconfigを使っているのですが、\nvim-lspだと、vim-lsp-settingとか、lsp用のスニペットなどあるみたいなので、乗り換えを考えています。\n\n使用してみて、どっちのほうが良かったなどありますか？","ts":"1636554599.331400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"/h3"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ef6c5d85-5fe5-4f44-8941-6766a6b6b6c8","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":":naruhodo:","ts":"1636526093.327000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ogOy"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0f1785a2-52e5-4438-8e53-d8deb7226ed0","type":"message","user":"U025UTETFDJ","text":"いや，普通に画像が数万枚あるデータセットのディレクトリですね","ts":"1636526043.326800","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"hear_no_evil","count":1,"users":["UL5G6QL5U"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"/nQHu"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c969de88-ccb9-4a6a-bb3e-a5522da005fc","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"数万個あるディレクトリって node_modules かな","ts":"1636525991.326400","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"sweat_smile","count":1,"users":["UL5G6QL5U"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"